    }
    
    .ftepic-banner-button {
      margin-top: 15px;
    }
    
    .advanced-settings-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  
  /* Dark mode styles */
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    body {
      background-color: #121212;
      background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #121212, #1e1e1e);
      color: #e0e0e0;
    }
    
    .input-container, .gallery-container, .comment-section, .scratchpad, .feature-card, .tool-card {
      background: #1e1e1e;
      color: #e0e0e0;
    }
    
    .gallery-title, .comment-title, .feature-title {
      color: #e0e0e0;
      border-bottom-color: #333;
    }
    
    .model-badge {
      background: #333;
      color: #e0e0e0;
    }
    
    .advanced-settings {
      background: #1a1a1a;
      border-color: #333;
    }
    
    .advanced-settings-title {
      color: #e0e0e0;
    }
    
    .scratchpad-content {
      background: #1e1e1e;
      border-color: #333;
      color: #e0e0e0;
    }
    
    .scratchpad-action {
      background: #333;
      color: #e0e0e0;
    }
    
    .scratchpad-action:hover {
      background: #444;
    }
    
    .notification {
      background: #1e1e1e;
      color: #e0e0e0;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="super-header">
  <h1>🎨 Ultimate AI Image Generator Pro</h1>
  <p>Transform your ideas into stunning visuals with our advanced AI</p>
  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <span class="feature-badge">Multiple AI Models</span>
    <span class="feature-badge">Professional Settings</span>
    <span class="feature-badge">High Resolution</span>
    <span class="feature-badge">NSFW Support</span>
    <span class="feature-badge">No Limits</span>
    <span class="feature-badge">Free to Use</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="scratchpad">
  <div class="scratchpad-title">
    <span>📝 Scratchpad</span>
    <div class="scratchpad-actions">
      <button class="scratchpad-action" onclick="saveScratchpad()">Save</button>
      <button class="scratchpad-action" onclick="clearScratchpad()">Clear</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <textarea id="scratchpad" class="scratchpad-content" placeholder="Use this area to save your favorite prompts or notes..."></textarea>
</div>

<div class="tip-box">
  <h4>✨ Pro Tips for Better Results</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>Be specific with details (lighting, mood, setting)</li>
    <li>Use {option1|option2} syntax for random variations</li>
    <li>Put [important elements] in brackets for emphasis</li>
    <li>Experiment with different models and art styles</li>
    <li>Save your favorite settings for consistent results</li>
    <li>Use the Subject, Location, and Time selectors for more control</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="tab-container">
  <div class="tab-buttons">
    <button class="tab-button active" onclick="showTab('basic')">Basic</button>
    <button class="tab-button" onclick="showTab('advanced')">Advanced</button>
    <button class="tab-button" onclick="showTab('examples')">Examples</button>
    <button class="tab-button" onclick="showTab('features')">Features</button>
    <button class="tab-button" onclick="showTab('help')">Help</button>
  </div>
  
  <div id="basic" class="tab-content active">
    <!-- Basic tab content is the main generator interface -->
  </div>
  
  <div id="advanced" class="tab-content">
    <h3>Advanced Techniques</h3>
    <p>Use these advanced prompting techniques to get even better results:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Weighted Prompts:</strong> Use (term:1.2) to increase importance or (term:0.8) to decrease</li>
      <li><strong>Negative Embedding:</strong> Add "negative:" before terms you want to avoid</li>
      <li><strong>Style Mixing:</strong> Combine multiple art styles like "digital art, watercolor style"</li>
      <li><strong>Reference Artists:</strong> Add "in the style of [artist]" for specific aesthetics</li>
      <li><strong>Technical Terms:</strong> Use photography/art terms like "bokeh", "rule of thirds", "golden ratio"</li>
    </ul>
    
    <div class="advanced-settings">
      <div class="advanced-settings-title" onclick="toggleAdvancedSettings(this)">
        AI Model Settings
      </div>
      <div class="advanced-settings-content">
        <div>
          <h4>Sampling Methods</h4>
          <p><strong>Euler a:</strong> Fast and good for general use</p>
          <p><strong>DPM++:</strong> Better quality but slower</p>
          <p><strong>DDIM:</strong> Good for consistent results</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Steps</h4>
          <p>20-30: Fast but basic quality</p>
          <p>30-50: Good balance</p>
          <p>50+: Highest quality but slower</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>CFG Scale</h4>
          <p>1-4: Creative but may ignore prompt</p>
          <p>5-9: Balanced adherence</p>
          <p>10+: Strict adherence to prompt</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div id="examples" class="tab-content">
    <h3>Example Prompts</h3>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 15px;">
