    <h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
    
    <div class="advanced-settings">
      <div class="advanced-settings-title" onclick="toggleAdvancedSettings(this)">
        What are the best settings for high-quality images?
      </div>
      <div class="advanced-settings-content">
        <p>For the highest quality images:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Choose SD XL or Realistic Vision models</li>
          <li>Set Steps to 40-50</li>
          <li>Use DPM++ 2M sampler</li>
          <li>Set CFG Scale between 7-9</li>
          <li>Select 4K resolution options</li>
          <li>Enable Upscale option</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
