    <div class="advanced-settings">
      <div class="advanced-settings-title" onclick="toggleAdvancedSettings(this)">
        How do I create consistent characters?
      </div>
      <div class="advanced-settings-content">
        <p>To create consistent characters across multiple images:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use the same seed number for all images</li>
          <li>Keep the same model and sampling method</li>
          <li>Be very specific about character details in your prompt</li>
          <li>Save successful prompts in the Scratchpad</li>
        </ul>
